{"doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR TI-RADS", "section": "随访与处理", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "text": "TR1—TR2 类结节通常无需穿刺，按临床常规随访。", "sha256": "d67f22eac9f2f18252ebe40a2fd7576f8ad93bda672ea52356ada3d3be86c455"}
{"doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR TI-RADS", "section": "穿刺与随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "text": "TR3 类结节最大径达到约 2.5 cm 时可考虑穿刺；未达阈值者以随访为主。", "sha256": "4e8b51e8775d06dd752eac15032ae7cce6ef42897d7a7c657cfada3d3206bdb5"}
{"doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR TI-RADS", "section": "穿刺与随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "text": "TR4 类结节最大径达到约 1.5 cm 时可考虑穿刺；1.0—1.5 cm 以随访为主。", "sha256": "2bcb2996900d91e74e7b41e60cf86f168a6023328f3dd235b96a0aad24c4a172"}
{"doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR TI-RADS", "section": "穿刺与随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47, "text": "TR5 类结节最大径达到约 1.0 cm 时可考虑穿刺；0.5—1.0 cm 可结合临床随访。", "sha256": "ccb34a9d0b5d3bef086f77f73665fed438ecba02190e0fc3af770f305d947ea1"}
{"doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-05", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR TI-RADS", "section": "生长定义", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "text": "随访中体积增大 ≥ 20%，或至少两个径线各增加 ≥ 2 mm，可视为结节生长。", "sha256": "a14eb422e2910aed7830a0789be4e647d89cffb8a3012a893816f3a63283586d"}
{"doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-06", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR TI-RADS", "section": "描述要素", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "text": "报告应记录成分、回声、形态、边缘与强回声灶五个维度，再给出分类。", "sha256": "334d02ab02351f0df0a2805de3be9f1c79f6c16b9856f0936f427550b01cfd56"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "section": "筛查随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "未见肺结节或仅见良性表现者，按年度低剂量 CT 继续筛查。", "sha256": "2b53e5d9ce06905a07d0705fe30313680a018e75e92e30f7757da1c6155bcb6b"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "section": "筛查随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "text": "实性结节 < 6 mm 或部分实性结节总径 < 6 mm，按年度筛查随访。", "sha256": "5e007f9d84080ad97f0c589066f2f353438b57005cb838c9ad5bc9988f76fba0"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "section": "筛查随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "text": "实性结节 ≥ 6 mm 且 < 8 mm，建议约 6 个月复查低剂量 CT。", "sha256": "d446d01138da826b8bc18abb13800417a48d24108e8d4a2e47a945fdcb7c68a6"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "section": "筛查随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "text": "实性结节 ≥ 8 mm 且 < 15 mm，建议约 3 个月复查，或结合临床进一步评估。", "sha256": "9cb7bf5a30a1e3de689e532b8b16fe055ca6047419fb96e63425bb67bd15fb84"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-05", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "section": "进一步评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "text": "具备可疑征象或明显生长者，进入进一步评估路径，由专科结合影像与临床决定后续方式。", "sha256": "b4c51a48e1d6b3dab2f32f6c60e43ee7604a3056853c466ecab8729fd5e5c2d0"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-06", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "section": "比较原则", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "判读时应与既往检查比较，结节大小变化与类别调整需记录依据。", "sha256": "3c76ed8908819c3e9388aca68c35d91443456e28b143d3b82212aed191ff1734"}
{"doc_id": "GL-FLEISCHNER-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Fleischner 偶发肺结节建议", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "低风险人群单发实性结节 < 6 mm，通常无需常规随访。", "sha256": "b1cf4a702bd96c1c0689b1e48e009d9d744b52ea2edd29a1de545fde5df54a71"}
{"doc_id": "GL-FLEISCHNER-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Fleischner 偶发肺结节建议", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "text": "单发实性结节 6—8 mm，建议 6—12 个月复查，可考虑 18—24 个月再复查。", "sha256": "2265e4dbc3c0f81dd21ecdcc921420efe79cf28220647c1220e1530cb39142e6"}
{"doc_id": "GL-FLEISCHNER-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Fleischner 偶发肺结节建议", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48, "text": "单发实性结节 > 8 mm，可考虑约 3 个月复查、PET/CT 或组织学评估，由专科综合决定。", "sha256": "675af75599b912f9531fb1992bab1b8c42e0528dbd4ddca604a5402854a4673d"}
{"doc_id": "GL-FLEISCHNER-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Fleischner 偶发肺结节建议", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "text": "单发磨玻璃结节 < 6 mm，通常无需常规随访。", "sha256": "48e618f8cb885a6dcfb31a72c70fc483e39612394f974a4ff9b2e7e890306a0e"}
{"doc_id": "GL-FLEISCHNER-05", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Fleischner 偶发肺结节建议", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "text": "单发磨玻璃结节 ≥ 6 mm，建议 6—12 个月复查，稳定后可延长随访间隔。", "sha256": "4fe2238259fac0e902da4d3c95962f06523cf774a32ceb438dbbf34cd1941017"}
{"doc_id": "GL-FLEISCHNER-06", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Fleischner 偶发肺结节建议", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41, "text": "部分实性结节 ≥ 6 mm，建议 3—6 个月复查；实性成分增大时进入进一步评估。", "sha256": "9d7410886a0e5a2cf32398babd7db52f641c038c6262f82a103b15b3f38cf53f"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BIRADS-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR BI-RADS", "section": "补充评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "评估不完整，需要补充影像或与既往片比较后再给出最终分类。", "sha256": "598dda26ad068c639b58a360a534894735c0e3e7e8b8a39b8c045e8d3f167744"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BIRADS-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR BI-RADS", "section": "常规筛查", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "text": "阴性或良性发现，按年龄与风险进入常规筛查流程。", "sha256": "e823fd09a0554230949d5f6993d4b239afacdd36e0e6546ae82743f4d09c8ead"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BIRADS-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR BI-RADS", "section": "短期随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "可能良性，建议短期随访，通常约 6 个月，并评估稳定性。", "sha256": "8d745be062f6a848d7a3ed3a9b526a3e3226f0a0ff3396ce017c965d91cfb9fd"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BIRADS-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR BI-RADS", "section": "组织学评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "可疑恶性，考虑组织学评估，具体方式由专科结合影像与临床决定。", "sha256": "9777eb7eb5ab3f262299692665400021305a759a879cfbe7d39c6e4e7a3a09a0"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BIRADS-05", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR BI-RADS", "section": "组织学评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "text": "高度提示恶性，应进行组织学评估并进入相应处理路径。", "sha256": "d3e25bc7831f4651ac1bf5f21118b48b988099ecfe4576580c3e0fbb99dc3bb8"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BIRADS-06", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR BI-RADS", "section": "已知恶性", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "已获组织学证实的恶性病变，用于治疗前评估与随访，不用于筛查。", "sha256": "3dfca432b871d6f5aa683dd0d2fdef54781f7a5f4f6a0d16726279c4e0efeb0f"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LIRADS-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR LI-RADS", "section": "监测", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "text": "肯定良性或很可能良性，按既定监测方案继续随访。", "sha256": "2cea4b3bdce0fc12a2afb4df9d99a91c1f61d710b3f7528612f8da705593e70b"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LIRADS-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR LI-RADS", "section": "复查", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "恶性可能性中等，建议缩短间隔复查，通常约 3—6 个月。", "sha256": "ab55f5fc25df54830ed6940029fa1b27b82c78d0361a67f48793afa5d7fc8a06"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LIRADS-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR LI-RADS", "section": "多学科评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "text": "很可能为恶性，建议多学科讨论，可考虑活检或按影像随访策略处理。", "sha256": "9ff50b9ca89b3d0101d224c0daa0ba08291da172add380b7e27ed29386506c82"}
{"doc_id": "GL-LIRADS-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "ACR LI-RADS", "section": "处理路径", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "肯定为肝细胞癌的影像诊断类别，进入相应处理路径，由专科评估。", "sha256": "85480126d3cb4ebeb674de3602f810d4a22498a4f5d6760dfd266190abfcd87d"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BOSNIAK-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Bosniak 分类", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "text": "单纯性囊肿，通常无需随访。", "sha256": "9e17c79309491a833037536b7354a14e8b96bd091b76c6cfa06770e21cf1333f"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BOSNIAK-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Bosniak 分类", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "text": "良性表现囊肿，通常无需随访。", "sha256": "ea8eb4dbfe76ed9e3f34693c53ce4b40879e8e656bbd3918abc2e36bb72054ec"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BOSNIAK-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Bosniak 分类", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "text": "可能良性，建议约 6 个月复查，稳定后可延长间隔。", "sha256": "8f24a4eb90e1d1b3b2fcf5842750ab2101d89096d2f88acd46c59b61c52da63b"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BOSNIAK-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Bosniak 分类", "section": "手术评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "性质不确定，考虑手术评估，具体由泌尿专科结合整体情况决定。", "sha256": "4b41108acd815a4f3e9cd9f05afb186c5fca27e3f0134a44fce922e022a90f47"}
{"doc_id": "GL-BOSNIAK-05", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "Bosniak 分类", "section": "手术评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "text": "明显恶性表现，进入手术评估路径。", "sha256": "6a08f253e0faa8a592c3db1535431afa18bb1a1fe243e7a450daa0a72443e947"}
{"doc_id": "GL-PIRADS-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "PI-RADS", "section": "临床路径", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "text": "极低或低风险，按临床与 PSA 结果常规管理。", "sha256": "1eaf16a4f31d6b4fafe3bd00a7323332c1274c6ffb565512d33ec67c389deb9e"}
{"doc_id": "GL-PIRADS-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "PI-RADS", "section": "临床路径", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "风险不确定，是否活检需结合 PSA、临床与既往结果综合决定。", "sha256": "a7f7388f30cb41df5536b26dae745e09eced907f0edf40531a1c16fb9d3647c4"}
{"doc_id": "GL-PIRADS-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "PI-RADS", "section": "临床路径", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "text": "高风险，考虑靶向活检，由泌尿专科安排。", "sha256": "a41f2f589006b13240f242f70283e6806eca99f4ba27550b81cabc6cd78d5053"}
{"doc_id": "GL-ORADS-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "O-RADS", "section": "补充评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "text": "评估不完整，需要补充检查后再分类。", "sha256": "af04e9ee245af6a932e55985972723cacd4c2ce44c54bc4f50537e7c40ba9f38"}
{"doc_id": "GL-ORADS-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "O-RADS", "section": "常规", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "text": "生理性或良性表现，按常规妇科随访。", "sha256": "f4f2424457e179a64efd9ab9e3cd619489e8bee550816bbb3f916124bded9673"}
{"doc_id": "GL-ORADS-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "O-RADS", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "低风险，可考虑短期随访或补充 MRI，由妇科结合临床决定。", "sha256": "7f34b6b87365908f2c8361861d8e10e8460bfd06271ad4ea351c6b43e331a855"}
{"doc_id": "GL-ORADS-04", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "O-RADS", "section": "专科评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "text": "中高风险，建议妇科评估，必要时补充 MRI 或转诊。", "sha256": "5a8e2f0f6134df1283fd99b1a33f3aeb016ae6e259c50bcff05401f2e2ec93ff"}
{"doc_id": "GL-ORADS-05", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "O-RADS", "section": "专科评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "text": "高风险，建议妇科肿瘤专科评估。", "sha256": "435c3f78657a964f89edb66cf4e4ce00487ed545e290888057ad828beb49c281"}
{"doc_id": "GL-GB-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "胆囊息肉管理共识", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "text": "无其他危险因素的 < 6 mm 胆囊息肉，可考虑定期超声随访。", "sha256": "23553989aef02ba14443ee8022f8be60b9f7106c7d9d367bd44adcd3651ab005"}
{"doc_id": "GL-GB-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "胆囊息肉管理共识", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "text": "6—9 mm 息肉，建议缩短间隔随访，并评估生长速度与危险因素。", "sha256": "3a6cd2af3b39cdf524c806eaf0f051e8b3f7f0ee977837914326a10cd9fd1ab7"}
{"doc_id": "GL-GB-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "胆囊息肉管理共识", "section": "手术评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "text": "≥ 10 mm 或伴危险因素者，考虑外科评估。", "sha256": "9416aca38d75523733898e26c56b88a9f2cd105320dcea6013a7197849b25b31"}
{"doc_id": "GL-PC-01", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "胰腺囊性病变管理共识", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "text": "小于 1 cm 的囊性病变，可结合风险分层定期随访。", "sha256": "376092f6e289bebd75faa0fb07e6060978fc7504d1a5f24b77b92de2b486145e"}
{"doc_id": "GL-PC-02", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "胰腺囊性病变管理共识", "section": "随访", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "text": "1—3 cm 病变按形态与主胰管情况分层，随访间隔由专科确定。", "sha256": "fecd7dcbcdf61e7d5b0a53268d335057aa516098b4d3a8ebed1790ee7570ee62"}
{"doc_id": "GL-PC-03", "doc_kind": "guideline", "title": "胰腺囊性病变管理共识", "section": "多学科评估", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "text": "≥ 3 cm 或伴主胰管扩张、实性成分等高危征象者，建议多学科评估。", "sha256": "3ecfffbbdf1e56cc88984b8dad359a3ee27a99d0f9ffd28a0d42114e1f78bf02"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-001", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "磨玻璃影", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "text": "肺野密度轻度增高，但其内血管与支气管边缘仍可辨认；不掩盖其内血管与支气管轮廓。", "sha256": "8298e5b342a1aae42f1fc75e344050e4506bdae9f051aa97f12d40e253c2b649"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-002", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "实变", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "肺实质密度均匀增高，掩盖其内血管走行，常可见空气支气管征。", "sha256": "bc33c080d861f8b0006a7735bf36914fe8af7e6d00179385c01e875e1b5e3a42"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-003", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "结节", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "text": "类圆形、边界相对清楚的局灶性密度增高影，通常以最大径界值区分结节与肿块。", "sha256": "133315be0a19aac6556c279b7dcbfe8222f005d24af9d4304aed764960b85c91"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-004", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "肿块", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "体积较大的局灶性占位，常伴形态不规则、分叶或边缘毛糙等表现。", "sha256": "1e147efa223dda8d086231421b441987344c39163cb585c3f20f1077d998ec7b"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-005", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "空洞", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "病灶内出现含气的透亮区，周围有壁；按壁厚可分为厚壁与薄壁。", "sha256": "0261e78be0903a7f9b4578faa108d713ed37384c5fe9b57c91730cd7ee83b1f8"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-006", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "钙化", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "text": "密度接近骨皮质的斑点、条状或环状影；形态可为点状、层状、爆米花样或环形。", "sha256": "f4073cc04ebe82134ed7d5e9929170fa86a0b942e3263200a402e295cbcfbede"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-007", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "胸腔积液", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "text": "胸膜腔内液体聚集，立位胸片表现为肋膈角变钝或下肺野均匀致密影，CT 上呈新月形低密度区。", "sha256": "e81145c00c2bb9868e1806870099749796f775869d2e9d40725b3deda34f1d61"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-008", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "气胸", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "text": "胸膜腔内出现气体，可见脏层胸膜线，其外肺纹理消失。", "sha256": "dd0488ab319810d0ac2895314cdd2d35c18375a272a3bbd3e1c44518661a0b80"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-009", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "纵隔增宽", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "text": "正位胸片上纵隔轮廓超过常规宽度，CT 可进一步区分血管、淋巴结或脂肪成分。", "sha256": "af36dc4b7c69f61b9e580b2c865b1fc3e6fe4f7c027d17de02fa1ff9b9056af4"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-010", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "心影增大", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "正位胸片上心胸比增大，或 CT 上心腔径线超出参考范围。", "sha256": "c7ff30f2ef7578456492cb02262e6451f0a603f76a3a4959f706e8fd693ba9c5"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-011", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "网状影", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "text": "肺内细线状影交织成网，常提示间质增厚；可伴蜂窝影或牵拉性支气管扩张。", "sha256": "d6d6c32d4936dae584eae93640b4ebd951e3c7874a8d3e9ecd55e46427f1cb7f"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-012", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "蜂窝影", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "text": "成簇的厚壁囊状透亮影，直径数毫米至厘米，多位于胸膜下与基底段，常与网状影并存。", "sha256": "2e8acda70b086e40abccba5bc5f6c4744c975023377f7557ffc588c5e40dda75"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-013", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "支气管扩张", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "text": "支气管管腔不可逆性扩大，可呈柱状、囊状或静脉曲张状，常伴管壁增厚。", "sha256": "2c3a60f1fe20ccf84df8262cb4a10c2e9fdc7993103b82377afaecfedfbb6762"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-014", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "空气支气管征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "text": "实变区内可见含气的支气管影，呈管状或分支状低密度。", "sha256": "9e36a1c2a0e0479210c186f7250cea7e85e559e1b96bea13f436c69ea1775759"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-015", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "晕征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "text": "结节或肿块周围环绕一圈磨玻璃样密度影。", "sha256": "6e6cd3eb58dfca6fe6fe60982d4bbbbcb3eb51c381e8e7f9bbab268a782c24c0"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-016", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "反晕征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "text": "中心磨玻璃影周围环绕一圈新月形或环形实变影。", "sha256": "dbee20469ffe82162ae28f069d2a6e45508d5c55b447645bbb15b09edb8137df"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-017", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "树芽征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "text": "细支气管扩张伴管腔内充填，形成分支状结构末端连着小结节，形似树芽。", "sha256": "f71247f8b269cd03be7f0833d8738adf23fbd42c33254be5685a80bee0633f60"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-018", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "铺路石征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "text": "磨玻璃影背景上叠加增厚的网格状小叶间隔与小叶内线。", "sha256": "d7a501bf58b91a6f26f1b4dac9c20d314dafca6d3df52c7f0b5fdaeed7392e44"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-019", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "肺不张", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "text": "肺组织含气量减少、体积缩小、密度增高，可伴叶间裂移位与纵隔牵拉。", "sha256": "d98ff7d341a1ab766f39d59e0011af66b9055307f5c356f61effb0795c6ddbe1"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-020", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "胸膜增厚", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "text": "胸膜线状或带状增厚，可局限或弥漫，伴或不伴钙化。", "sha256": "e856b4a6dd201608bc0bca0f7f45ce6819136eee1022964650b313fab254fb60"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-021", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "低密度灶", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "CT 上密度低于周围实质的局灶区域，可呈囊性、实性或混合性。", "sha256": "f97b9668aba3ef4993febf1d1f3c9cb03a6124a8498d438eba3146d8b9984d46"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-022", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "环形强化", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "病灶周边呈环状强化，中心不强化或强化程度低，可伴壁厚薄不均。", "sha256": "10816c146760564d0d8972cf9f2898aab707058a4a0b2d90b3f05d039653991e"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-023", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "快进快出", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "动脉期病灶明显强化，门脉期或延迟期强化程度低于周围肝实质。", "sha256": "7f7f19775fdf6778984dc7762a597806637a9d484b75c52eaadf3c15c3645c11"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-024", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "双管征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "text": "胆总管与主胰管同时扩张，两者在胰头区域汇聚。", "sha256": "166499a18612cb762e2185a6002d6ac68a62ed604f27b48ccff6c325d5d4acc6"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-025", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "胆管扩张", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "text": "肝内胆管呈树枝状增宽，或胆总管内径超出参考上限。", "sha256": "9884fb231ffc87b8c2255aa23cff3354947909db93530702ab406907c9fbee36"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-026", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "腹腔积液", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "text": "腹腔内液体聚集，CT 上呈低密度区，超声上呈无回声区，可随体位改变分布。", "sha256": "e50ecbb703c4aa2f9c54f919ce58ecbf618c95793920faf790e1056123bf7924"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-027", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "脂肪间隙模糊", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "器官周围脂肪内出现条索状或片状密度增高，提示局部炎症或浸润。", "sha256": "7c112f5d278e3b0371e015b0635030bb9d2bce8bc93a5f9057f484272f1ee091"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-028", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "淋巴结增大", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "淋巴结短径超出所在区域参考上限，可呈圆形、融合或伴坏死。", "sha256": "76e326f16ae4d2a9d553537818393f11b2bddd87fe3be0df0ee903a1a5fb5804"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-029", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "靶征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "text": "病灶呈同心圆样分层，中心与周边密度或信号不同。", "sha256": "f4ccf5d1adc942246608ab5f38577040d9b5cea94f825763fcd3492683597e66"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-030", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "假肾征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "肠壁增厚形成周边低回声、中心强回声的结构，形似肾脏切面。", "sha256": "216c967f88ea3642f7e39a331a388842baaf228a6eee29ef0bb1893e71f46b9a"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-031", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "胆囊壁增厚", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "text": "胆囊壁厚度超出参考值，可伴壁内血流增多或壁分层。", "sha256": "ae5db3399cab584b1af4253b8c4638baaa3eb39b9df1c3d7f1ccef3c10d5c1f4"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-032", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "胰腺钙化", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "text": "胰腺实质或胰管内点状、条状高密度影。", "sha256": "66aaccca8370e99a44a7dcbd77a2a0b04e5043b025e1e1ef39a39a5fee078d8b"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-033", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "肾积水", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "text": "肾盂肾盏扩张，呈无回声或低密度分支状结构，严重时肾实质变薄。", "sha256": "bc83b6e81ab1291db022460ceced563ede56d685c4f2ffb8943e98941a422e9f"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-034", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "肝内胆管结石", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "text": "肝内胆管走行区点状或条状高密度影，常伴远端胆管扩张。", "sha256": "c2806844d4724ea075909c3fe71076c7f54004d2bc5911b219c2a569adbc2079"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-035", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "T1 高信号", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "text": "T1 加权像上信号高于周围组织，常见于脂肪、出血、蛋白性液体或部分顺磁性物质。", "sha256": "8d14ab029b5cb79ac377abd4e04d79d67019a15f94eae4701fb3832f441b155a"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-036", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "T2 高信号", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "text": "T2 加权像上信号高于周围组织，常见于液体、水肿、炎症或部分病变。", "sha256": "b068de6e0d80d9c00808fd6c0c2dea8110789cb586ba00f4f5452d860ad229e8"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-037", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "弥散受限", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "text": "DWI 上呈高信号且 ADC 图对应区域呈低信号，提示水分子扩散受限。", "sha256": "14d24abe2201239ee019b8e3b3163552fb0670aa1c3d24027c917f62a15d65bc"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-038", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "脑膜强化", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "增强后脑膜线状或结节状强化，可沿脑沟、脑回或硬脑膜分布。", "sha256": "70ee3d0c0c43154657c15206a00c7f12a906ef41586405b86bdc5d80e6ee4453"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-039", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "脑回样强化", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "text": "增强后沿脑回皮层分布的条状或波浪状强化。", "sha256": "a02994daf060c2375d85492d707a969668be94500cecdb86317bb13e5ec96b97"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-040", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "占位效应", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "病变引起邻近结构受压、移位或变形，可伴脑沟变浅、脑室受压。", "sha256": "82f130a4db07ef3ff994eaa1ac98fc72ad8e155f85f8ed7550ea478073a7f10c"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-041", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "水肿带", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "text": "病变周围片状低密度（CT）或 T2 高信号（MR）区，边界不清，多累及白质。", "sha256": "68d25f059e0120a53866c99c9b5f49e64139d08dd27024ec988e81d0005df1c1"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-042", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "流空效应", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "text": "快速流动的血液在自旋回波序列上呈无信号区，表现为管状或点状低信号。", "sha256": "ea5ebefebe7efaac92e7ece494ae293937b974e9ae1902a59b8a302d34a2d53b"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-043", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "脑室扩大", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "text": "侧脑室或第三、第四脑室径线增大，可伴脑室周围间质水肿。", "sha256": "5eed159716a835995d3573476bb243028ddb7504fb2294b8f53f78c98c5c0867"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-044", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "中线移位", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "text": "透明隔、第三脑室等中线结构向对侧偏移。", "sha256": "20f2b1c83651ccee35b26013ebdc5513785e93d9e37f62bf8e21e2b48fcadfd9"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-045", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "CT 高密度出血", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "平扫 CT 上呈边界较清的高密度区，密度随出血时间变化。", "sha256": "b722230957f8b9190c0a9d5fc0111063d34bd395d48a79aabe060008ae33c640"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-046", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "腔隙灶", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "text": "深部脑组织内小灶性低密度（CT）或 T1 低、T2 高信号（MR），边界较清。", "sha256": "0b46469f8bf12620a72c1f2effbe220dede0b979ad7881f68db310c88e6ca382"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-047", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "半月板信号增高", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "半月板内出现 T2/PD 高信号，按是否达关节面分级描述。", "sha256": "974d953638b5938b167d744cf28cf7c1795afdf0a005c6221941bf77c7873dc6"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-048", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "骨髓水肿", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "text": "压脂 T2 或 STIR 序列上骨髓内片状高信号，T1 上呈低信号。", "sha256": "b86a0bfc2f33c8515cf85fa2e98ea85ebaefe77f9ba1d750122635df82d490e3"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-049", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "骨质破坏", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "text": "骨皮质或骨松质连续性中断、密度减低，可呈溶骨性、膨胀性或虫蚀样。", "sha256": "5cf3371af8e855f1cb77a6f290c8162851c859dba65bd868dff61505945adf96"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-050", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "骨膜反应", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "text": "沿骨皮质表面的新骨形成，可呈线状、层状、针状或 Codman 三角样。", "sha256": "02d948c9ccf9199b54a60c605dce7bf4c86461a0b7633c58e567b8a7556e49fe"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-051", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "硬化边", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "text": "病灶周围环形或半环形高密度带，边界清晰。", "sha256": "29dc555863a51e9d5efe90c79f0691751bf3fb323e376d88f618792a27c35885"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-052", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "关节积液", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "text": "关节腔内液体增多，MR 上 T2 高信号，超声上无回声区，可伴滑膜增厚。", "sha256": "5884852babecb84bf4c13235ba8c08d14dee4f7453780576e7b415e477cc2242"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-053", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "韧带信号增高", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "text": "韧带内出现 T2/PD 高信号，可伴纤维连续性中断或增粗。", "sha256": "65cc8c5066446bbe6f916b8c48d8f9090007c5a947a62e86d97db380b5923e94"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-054", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "病理性骨折", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "在原有骨病变基础上发生的骨折，常伴骨质破坏或异常骨密度。", "sha256": "3d7758aeacbcbb372893ac4317d67597f85051aaa4729aee95a472e571fdae53"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-055", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "毛刺征", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "text": "病灶边缘呈放射状细线影，向周围组织延伸。", "sha256": "058614cc997069a7f4bfe010aa26bc359a56855a682443c47b526c133da6e509"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-056", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "微钙化", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 50, "text": "钼靶上细小的钙化点，按形态（点状、无定形、粗糙不均、细线分支）与分布（散在、簇状、线样、段样）描述。", "sha256": "ddda07c0bdeb7597c831a9a70acda3cfaff1c719f4b73a8d05b6ae6ace8cea29"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-057", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "纵横比大于 1", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "超声横切面上病灶前后径大于横径，提示沿组织平面垂直生长。", "sha256": "dc0a20e19fb70ac0687d50248d546c9ea2506b66084dd7546cab4c8aacfa5a53"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-058", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "低回声结节", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "text": "超声上回声低于周围腺体组织的结节，可伴边界、形态、钙化等特征。", "sha256": "60c1c5909a404249ee6cdc112532969e8dede64f252244f7abaa1e8eb0777983"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-059", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "无回声区", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "text": "超声上内部无回声的暗区，后方常伴回声增强，提示液体成分。", "sha256": "a273ef89951c9ef00d9911c62a9eec2cfb94554150cad06d8c3429d849836966"}
{"doc_id": "SIGN-060", "doc_kind": "sign", "title": "后方声影", "section": "appearance", "page": null, "para": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "text": "强反射或强衰减结构后方出现的无回声带，常见于钙化、结石或气体。", "sha256": "90167d2ca47038139552fb51a5dcebddc91e391037051fb9eeeb55cbfe9fb1b1"}
